# Native Steam (games-util/steam-launcher from the steam-overlay). Appended ONLY
# for the standalone / full desktops when --steam native (the default). Needs the
# multilib hardened stage3 (ABI_X86_32) + the steam-overlay enabled — the builder
# sets both up (see the native-steam block in build-x86-host-stage4.sh). The thin
# mesh laptop/chromebook clients do NOT pull this (kept lean). The Steam library
# is pointed at /media/Steam by hugmesh-media-detect at runtime.
games-util/steam-launcher
